---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who writes EarlySpawn, how we check codes, and how to reach us.">
  <div class="wrap prose page">
    <h1>About {site.name}</h1>
    <p>{site.name} covers the games gaining players fastest, with codes, beginner guides, and game info in one place. We cover new games early, often before the bigger sites get to them.</p>

    <h2>Who writes this</h2>
    <p>Pages are written and maintained by {site.editor}. We use AI tools to help draft and keep pages up to date, and every page is checked by a person before it goes live. We'd rather say "we don't know yet" than guess.</p>

    <h2>How we check codes</h2>
    <p>Codes come from the game's own announcements, its Roblox page, or the developer's Discord, and we redeem them in-game before listing them. Every codes page shows the date it was last checked. Codes that stop working move to the expired list instead of quietly disappearing, and when a game has no working codes we say so and explain why.</p>

    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>If something on the site is wrong or out of date, tell us and we'll fix it: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Same address for new codes you've found, or games you want covered.</p>

    <p>{site.name} is a fan site. It isn't affiliated with or endorsed by Roblox Corporation or any game developer.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>.page { padding-top: 36px; } .page h1 { margin-bottom: 18px; }</style>
